'''Mount Veermok''' was a [[mountain]] on the [[planet]] [[Eriadu]] located to the north of the [[Orrineswa River]]. It was part of the [[Carrion Spike (location)|Carrion Spike]] and was owned by the [[Tarkin family]]. According to [[Jova Tarkin]], the family once offered developers all of the land between the river and Mount Veermok, but the offer was rejected.<ref name="Tarkin" />

